1330
02:00:06,125 --> 02:00:08,333
¿Jim, me escuchas desde allá?

1331
02:00:08,917 --> 02:00:12,000
Sí, te escucho, Bernard.

1332
02:00:08,917 --> 02:00:12,000
Estamos a medio camino.

1333
02:00:12,083 --> 02:00:15,542
La isla queda a 206 millas náuticas

1334
02:00:12,083 --> 02:00:15,542
