1349
02:00:44,834 --> 02:00:47,417
para devolver los animales a la isla...

1350
02:00:47,500 --> 02:00:50,041
y mantenerlos aislados.

1351
02:00:51,083 --> 02:00:54,208
Es imperativo que colaboremos...

1352
02:00:55,041 --> 02:00:59,125
con la agencia de conservación biológica

1353
02:00:55,041 --> 02:00:59,125
de Costa Rica...

1354
02:00:59,208 --> 02:01:01,500
